# SCH\_SelectControl.doCrossProbeSelect() method

Perform cross-probe selection

## Signature

```typescript
function doCrossProbeSelect(
	components?: Array<string>,
	pins?: Array<string>,
	nets?: Array<string>,
	highlight?: boolean,
	select?: boolean,
): boolean;
```

## Parameters

